



 Minutes of the FIGGY BAR RT Conference.

Date: 03/01/90   Time: 22:29EST

 The question on the door: "FOR...NEXT is accepted and DO...LOOP is not going
 away - is Forth well served by having two constructs that serve essentially
 the same purpose ?". Other items discussed include: QUANS, TO concept,F-PC,
 BBL,X3J14 cost,three stacks (?),applications shops,systems houses. 

Attendees:
[[Doug] D.PHILIPS3]
[GARY-S]
[[Kevin] APPERT]
[[Wil] W.BADEN1]
[[Speaking!] FIGCHAPTERS]
[M.HAWLEY]

