<D.PHILIPS3> is here.
<GARY-S> not Monitoring.
<APPERT> is here.
<[Doug] D.PHILIPS3> Hi All!
<[Doug] D.PHILIPS3> Is Forth really hurt by the duplication?
<GARY-S> Did FOR..NEXT accomplish anything worthy of duplication ?
<[Doug] D.PHILIPS3> Did DO LOOP?
